           <div class="project-desc prose">
 <p>When my analytics host went down, I researched with Claude <a href="/research/visits-without-cookies" data-visits-event="doc-visits-without-cookies">what a cookieless counter can
 know</a>, then built lib-visits with Claude Code, from design doc to
 first release in one day. A 3 KB script and a small Rust collector count visits and the path each
 one took, with no cookies, no stored ID and no fingerprinting.</p>
